---
title: "deposit (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: ensure_version_matches + validate_market
    q_validate --> q_check_circuit: assert !circuit_break_triggered
    q_check_circuit --> q_time: now = clock.timestamp_ms / 1000
    q_time --> q_check_amount: assert coin.value != 0
    q_check_amount --> q_check_pause: assert !deposit_paused
    q_check_pause --> q_accrue: accrue_interest(reserve, now)
    q_accrue --> q_check_limit: assert !deposit_limit_breached(amount, max_deposit)
    q_check_limit --> q_mint: ctoken = reserve.mint_ctokens(coin)
    q_mint --> q_check_obligation: assert obligation.market_id matches
    q_check_obligation --> q_check_no_debt: assert coin_type not in obligation.debts
    q_check_no_debt --> q_deposit_ctoken: obligation.deposit_ctoken(ctoken)
    q_deposit_ctoken --> q_rate_limit: emode.deposit_limiter.reduce_outflow(now, amount)
    q_rate_limit --> q_update_mining: update_obligation_reward_manager(deposit_type)
    q_update_mining --> q_emit: emit DepositEvent
    q_emit --> [*]

    note right of q_deposit_ctoken
        INV-001: Cannot deposit an asset that is currently borrowed by same obligation
        INV-002: ctoken_amount = int_div(deposit_amount, exchange_rate)
        INV-003: reserve.cash increases by deposit_amount
        INV-004: reserve.total_supply increases by ctoken_amount
        INV-005: exchange_rate = (cash + debt - cash_reserve) / total_supply
    end note
